## 1. `macapp/WorkroomApp/Views/DiffViewer.swift` — full structure

File is 742 lines. Key sections:

**Struct properties / state** (lines 15-77): `descriptor`, `directory`, `projectRoot`, `viewModeOverride`, `showsFileHeader`, `headerModeBinding`; `@State state: LoadState`, `loadedKey`, `highlightedLines: [Int: AttributedString]`, `highlightedOldLines: [Int: AttributedString]`, `loadToken`, `emphasis: (deletions:[Int:Range<Int>], additions:[Int:Range<Int>])`, `sbsRows: SideBySideRows?` (boxed, non-Equatable reference type per WORKROOM-2S, defined lines 91-94), `@Default(.diffViewMode)`. `sideBySideMinWidth: CGFloat = 700` (line 77).

**`body`** (96-127): wraps `content` in an optional file-header VStack, attaches `.task(id: fetchKey)` (load-once guard, lines 118-122) and `.task(id: highlightKey)` (126) for async syntax highlighting.

**`load()`** (255-285): sets `.loading`, clears both highlight dicts, resolves the diff (via `DiffResolver` or `UITestFixture`), sets `state`, computes `emphasis = IntraLineDiff.emphasis(for: diff)`, and builds `sbsRows = SideBySideRows(diff.hunks.map(UnifiedDiff.sideBySideRows(for:)))` — **this is where the per-hunk side-by-side pairing happens, once, synchronously, at diff-load time** — a natural place to also do line-height pre-measurement.

**`applyHighlight()`** (290-351): async, resolves a syntax grammar by path/shebang, fetches file content (new side always; old side only if the diff has deletions), runs `SyntaxHighlighter.shared.spans(for:grammar:)` off-main via `Task.detached`, then `DiffHighlightMapper.attributedLines(diff:content:spans:tokens:...)` to build `highlightedLines`/`highlightedOldLines` (`[Int: AttributedString]` keyed by 1-based line number, new-side and old-side respectively). Runs are cancellation-checked at every await point. Additions/context get highlighted; deletions only get highlighted if `oldContent` is fetched successfully (skipped in UI-test fixture mode).

**`diffBody`** (371-379):
```swift
@ViewBuilder private func diffBody(_ diff: UnifiedDiff) -> some View {
  GeometryReader { proxy in
    if showSideBySide(width: proxy.size.width) {
      sideBySideBody(diff)
    } else {
      unifiedBody(diff)
    }
  }
}
