Four files, all pure-logic/unit style (no view-rendering, no snapshot testing, no `ViewInspector` — grepped, none present in the repo or `project.yml`). SwiftUI view bodies aren't tested directly anywhere in this codebase; instead, view logic is pulled out into `static func`s on the view type and unit-tested as pure functions. This is the established convention a new DiffViewer test should follow.

